Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|custom.properties|default.layout.template.id=1_column|
		|testray.main.component.name|Announcements|
	And these variables
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|custom.properties|default.layout.template.id=1_column|
		|testray.main.component.name|Announcements|
		|pageName|Announcements Page|
		|portletName|Announcements|
Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And Page add
		|pageName|Announcements Page|
	Then Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Announcements|
Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Add Announcements Entry
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|PGAnnouncements#AddAnnouncementsEntry|
	When Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Announcements Page|
	And AnnouncementsEntry add PG
		|distributionScope|General|
		|entryContent|Announcements Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Announcements Entry Title|
		|entryURL|http://www.liferay.com|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Announcements Page|
	Then AnnouncementsEntry view PG
		|announcementType|General|
		|distributionScope|General|
		|entryContent|Announcements Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Announcements Entry Title|
		|entryURL|http://www.liferay.com|
Scenario: Add Announcements Entry Future Date
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Announcements Page|
	When AnnouncementsEntry add Entry With Future Date
		|distributionScope|General|
		|entryContent|Announcements Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Announcements Entry Title|
		|entryURL|http://www.liferay.com|
	And Pause at locator '10000'
	And AssertClick the value 'New' at locator 'Announcements#NAVIGATION_ENTRIES_NEW'
	And AssertTextNotPresent the value 'Announcements Entry Title'
	And Pause at locator '120000'
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Announcements Page|
	Then AnnouncementsEntry view PG
		|announcementType|General|
		|distributionScope|General|
		|entryContent|Announcements Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Announcements Entry Title|
		|entryURL|http://www.liferay.com|
Scenario: Add Announcements Entry Past Expiration Date
Priority: 3
	Given Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Announcements Page|
	When AnnouncementsEntry add PG
		|distributionScope|General|
		|entryContent|Announcements Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Announcements Entry Title|
		|entryURL|http://www.liferay.com|
		|expirationDate|12/31/2013|
		|pastDate|true|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Announcements Page|
	And AssertTextNotPresent the value 'Announcements Entry Title'
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Announcements and Alerts|
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'General' at locator 'Dropdown#FILTER'
	Then AssertTextEquals the value 'No entries were found.' at locator 'Message#NO_ENTRIES'
Scenario: Add Announcements Entry Priority Important
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Announcements Page|
	When AnnouncementsEntry add PG
		|distributionScope|General|
		|entryContent|Announcements Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Announcements Entry Title|
		|entryURL|http://www.liferay.com|
		|priority|Important|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Announcements Page|
	Then AnnouncementsEntry view PG
		|announcementType|General|
		|distributionScope|General|
		|entryContent|Announcements Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Announcements Entry Title|
Scenario: Add Announcements Entry Site
Priority: 3
	Given ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	When Site add Blank CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Announcements Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Announcements Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Announcements|
	And AnnouncementsEntry add PG
		|distributionScope|General|
		|entryContent|Announcements Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Announcements Entry Title|
		|entryURL|http://www.liferay.com|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Announcements Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	Then AnnouncementsEntry view PG
		|announcementType|General|
		|distributionScope|General|
		|entryContent|Announcements Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Announcements Entry Title|
Scenario: Delete Announcements Entry
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	When these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|PGAnnouncements#DeleteAnnouncementsEntry|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Announcements Page|
	And AnnouncementsEntry add PG
		|distributionScope|General|
		|entryContent|Announcements Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Announcements Entry Title|
		|entryURL|http://www.liferay.com|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Announcements Page|
	And AnnouncementsEntry delete PG
		|distributionScope|General|
		|entryContent|Announcements Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Announcements Entry Title|
	Then AnnouncementsEntry view Delete PG
		|entryContent|Announcements Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Announcements Entry Title|
Scenario: Edit Announcements Entry
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	When these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|PGAnnouncements#EditAnnouncementsEntry|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Announcements Page|
	And AnnouncementsEntry add PG
		|distributionScope|General|
		|entryContent|Announcements Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Announcements Entry Title|
		|entryURL|http://www.liferay.com|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Announcements Page|
	And AnnouncementsEntry edit PG
		|distributionScope|General|
		|entryContent|Announcements Entry Content|
		|entryContentEdit|Announcements Entry Content Edit|
		|entryTitle|Announcements Entry Title|
		|entryTitleEdit|Announcements Entry Title Edit|
		|entryURLEdit|http://www.alloyui.com|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Announcements Page|
	Then AnnouncementsEntry view PG
		|announcementType|General|
		|distributionScope|General|
		|entryContent|Announcements Entry Content Edit|
		|entryTitle|Announcements Entry Title Edit|
Scenario: View Previous Announcement Entries
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	When these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|PGAnnouncements#ViewPreviousAnnouncementEntries|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Announcements Page|
	And AnnouncementsEntry add PG
		|distributionScope|General|
		|entryContent|Announcements Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Announcements Entry Title|
		|entryURL|http://www.liferay.com|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Announcements Page|
	And AnnouncementsEntry mark As Read PG
		|entryContent|Announcements Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Announcements Entry Title|
	And AnnouncementsEntry view Previous PG
		|announcementType|General|
		|distributionScope|General|
		|entryContent|Announcements Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Announcements Entry Title|
	And AssertClick the value 'New' at locator 'Announcements#NAVIGATION_ENTRIES_NEW'
	Then AnnouncementsEntry view No PG
		|entryTitle|Announcements Entry Title|

